# Format: dsv
# DESCRIPTION:ACNAME:STAT:OLD:NEW:DD-MM-YYYY:[MARK]
# Description is not used in-game except for MARK and in debugging messages
# ACNAME should match NAME from dat/bombers
# Stat is one of cost, speed, alt, capwt, capbulk, svp, defn, desch, deflk, fail, accu, range, crew, loads,
#                navs, flags, mrcap, mran, cran, cmcap, cmran, nil
#   nil is used with MARK to set the name of mark 0; it sets no stat
#   mr is max-range condition, cr is concrete runway, cm is both
#   if not flags.HEAVY, cr and cmr automatically get grass mods copied
# old is ignored by game
# new is the new value of the stat (or, for flags, the flag to set)
# MARK indicates this only affects new-build aircraft (only supports a limited selection of stats)

# WARNING: mods which touch the same stat on the same type MUST be in date order!
#  (The game does not check for this!)
# So please keep this whole file in date order.

